518493932ecb"],

Cell["\<\
In this notebook, I propose a technique in the Wolfram language, \
\[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] (up-down) indexing, for tensorial \
calculations in physics. The technique is self-contained, has no external \
dependencies, and is novel, so far as I know. The implementation is an early \
prototype of an embedded compiler for a \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] \
calculus. Several directions for improvement are noted as we go through \
examples.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9754309671193943`*^9, 3.975431061601799*^9}, {
   3.97543117083074*^9, 3.975431178038581*^9}, {3.975505647295991*^9, 
   3.975505655747813*^9}, {3.975506151656768*^9, 3.975506173435577*^9}, {
