  3.975969026783049*^9, 3.975969188953964*^9, 3.975969431505509*^9, 
   3.9760227616058817`*^9, 3.976026307177787*^9, 3.97619381577812*^9, {
   3.9762850040231647`*^9, 3.9762850226394176`*^9}, {3.976286335808097*^9, 
   3.976286348018681*^9}, 3.9762895279170218`*^9, 3.976289643243042*^9, 
   3.976289692051598*^9, 3.9762946760038757`*^9, 3.976294759273426*^9, 
   3.976295685047874*^9, 3.9763062598020782`*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[37]=",ExpressionUUID->"067bcfbc-9bad-4f98-a0ae-be6730eb9521"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This reproduces Carlip\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Equation 1.7 closely, and exactly \
after multiplying -1 through each of the parenthesized factors in the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", "/", 
    SuperscriptBox["r", "3"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a919b93d-0e7d-4ab0-b3fe-3a3baeec362e"],
 " term. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9759692892143173`*^9, 3.975969303475263*^9}, {
  3.976022572388363*^9, 3.9760226252843933`*^9}, {3.976285122636673*^9, 
  3.976285125948542*^9}, {3.976286356815889*^9, 3.97628636080863*^9}, {
  3.9762936114997253`*^9, 3.976293677984531*^9}, {3.976293711164579*^9, 
  3.9762937481811438`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d73f7ee8-2e57-4498-ac79-\
e3f7131eccc9"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Resolving Aberration", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975970904542493*^9, 
  3.975970909448534*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ebee4135-26af-444f-8594-\
37f63bf41070"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We close by deriving Carlip\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Equations 1.8 and 1.9 and \
recapitulating his argument that the electric field, while incorporating only \
retarded terms, thus relativistically correct, \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]bends\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] the force vector via its velocity-dependent terms, \
toward the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]instantaneous\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
direction. If the source does not change its velocity, the correction is \
exact. Relativity maintains the illusion of pointing the force, measured at \
the test location ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"x", ","}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4500a57a-5acd-4721-a0b7-79d7cbc9299f"],
 " towards the instantaneous position of the source."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975970949713709*^9, 3.9759711353399343`*^9}, {
   3.975971678004011*^9, 3.975971678917787*^9}, 3.976022805752016*^9, {
   3.976315507473996*^9, 
   3.97631551504823*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b3ab96bf-836a-4a8f-9c9b-\
010569efb0dd"],

Cell["\<\
Start by decomposing the separation and velocity into their space and time \
components. We\[CloseCurlyQuote]re interested specifically in the space \
components to assess the direction in which they point.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976022828203092*^9, 
  3.976022865814226*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"101ae2f0-aeb0-490d-8a52-\
4453f10a57a1"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Components of the Separation Vector", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975862405959635*^9, 3.97586241094553*^9}, {
  3.975972142957473*^9, 
  3.975972146331381*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dd7475ca-1653-45da-aa90-\
2555d80f8442"],

Cell["Start again with the definition", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975787040179435*^9, 3.975787099126645*^9}, {
   3.975787140050578*^9, 3.975787182914392*^9}, {3.9758008347154007`*^9, 
   3.975800839623537*^9}, {3.9758444285397177`*^9, 3.975844430024726*^9}, {
   3.9759614097748537`*^9, 3.975961410474551*^9}, {3.97597215936935*^9, 
   3.9759721662819347`*^9}, 
   3.976022879526536*^9},ExpressionUUID->"66d37998-c6ab-4ee3-9d7b-\
6097141de19e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Mu]"], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["x", "\[Mu]"], "-", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["z", "\[Mu]"], 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      SubscriptBox["s", "R"], ")"}]}]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97578723468163*^9, 3.975787275450199*^9}, {
  3.9757874893226557`*^9, 3.9757875004806013`*^9}, {3.975787632073148*^9, 
  3.975787632074938*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dd749a86-dd6b-4679-9ed8-\
3a63a0304430"],

Cell["which has space (3\[NoBreak]-\[NoBreak]vector) slice", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975800844829603*^9, 3.9758008761205*^9}, {
  3.9758636404640083`*^9, 
  3.9758636412577763`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"905a08d6-9788-49a6-88fe-\
f0dee473500e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "space"], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["x",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], "-", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["z",
      FontWeight->"Bold"], 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      SubscriptBox["s", "R"], ")"}]}]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97578731970385*^9, 3.975787360274549*^9}, {
  3.975787511759602*^9, 3.975787513677251*^9}, {3.9757876387431107`*^9, 
  3.9757876387559147`*^9}, {3.975862431927939*^9, 
  3.975862437985482*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b546f2d1-8c86-4a83-a20e-\
7547b5c53dcc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "defining 3\[NoBreak]-\[NoBreak]vectors ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["x",
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "93190b19-c005-4cd0-9787-3b10464e215e"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["z",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], "(", 
    SubscriptBox["s", "R"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2a7eb805-61b5-4f53-83db-d542d79c60ce"],
 " ",
 StyleBox["en passant",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". The ",
 StyleBox["retarded spatial distance",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["R", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "27d331a9-527e-45e5-b985-7487fa15026d"],
 ", not invariant like ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["r", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bf21c3cb-4b10-415c-916d-6b6cf0cd9d80"],
 ", is"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975800882596943*^9, 3.9758008860899963`*^9}, {
  3.975802161695019*^9, 3.975802164056045*^9}, {3.975862192177155*^9, 
  3.975862261576208*^9}, {3.975863650282074*^9, 3.975863652794455*^9}, {
  3.9758842819461823`*^9, 
  3.975884315490757*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"17095269-7685-4381-ad81-\
1b7e1be41e7a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{"R", "\[Congruent]", 
   RowBox[{"\[LeftBracketingBar]", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["x",
      FontWeight->"Bold"], "-", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["z",
       FontWeight->"Bold"], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       SubscriptBox["s", "R"], ")"}]}]}], "\[RightBracketingBar]"}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9757874598610573`*^9, 3.9757874824688683`*^9}, {
  3.975787520230523*^9, 3.975787528842773*^9}, {3.97578764613335*^9, 
  3.975787646136039*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"faf80464-14aa-441b-9890-\
da58ae9aa90f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Defining a unit vector pointing from ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["x",
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "4f2bc364-c3d5-4b47-9366-a73d34f4ac42"],
 " to the retarded position of the source, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["z",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], "(", 
    SubscriptBox["s", "R"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "62e9a9a2-aa33-4cb2-a5c1-bc2d6f8214fb"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9758008922296333`*^9, 3.9758008996291933`*^9}, {
  3.975862273263755*^9, 
  3.975862317210443*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"28d24ca8-a1c7-498a-8652-\
9eba9354a5d7"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n",
      FontWeight->"Bold"], "^"],
    FontWeight->"Bold"], "=", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["x",
      FontWeight->"Bold"], "-", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["z",
       FontWeight->"Bold"], "(", 
      SubscriptBox["s", "R"], ")"}]}], "R"]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975787566550664*^9, 3.975787612627654*^9}, {
  3.975787660150002*^9, 
  3.97578766015239*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ae7c4c64-2f6e-495c-b273-\
fc7ae2da706b"],

Cell["we get ", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975800915203233*^9, 3.975800917284527*^9}, 
   3.9758622835498667`*^9, {3.9758636608548813`*^9, 
   3.975863661239192*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ec385715-a446-47a4-a19e-\
806b7696d688"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "space"], "=", 
   RowBox[{"R", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["n",
       FontWeight->"Bold"], "^"],
     FontWeight->"Bold"]}]}], TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9757880175932302`*^9, 3.9757880624783916`*^9}, 
   3.9758624454553947`*^9},
 CellTags->
  "SEPARATION VECTOR \
COMPONENTS",ExpressionUUID->"fde1e41b-a9f1-423c-bf1e-3e002cb17a22"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Because ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0"], ")"}], "=", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"\[LeftBracketingBar]", 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["x",
        FontWeight->"Bold"], "-", 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["z",
         FontWeight->"Bold"], "(", 
        SubscriptBox["s", "R"], ")"}]}], "\[RightBracketingBar]"}], "2"]}], 
   TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "208099cd-96df-47d8-aaa3-d8744f6424d8"],
 ", we conclude that"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975800929309634*^9, 
  3.9758010047381353`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"13c2e7dc-200b-4f0a-9e53-\
e2a65e76bb95"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0"], "=", "R"}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9757880009130507`*^9, 3.975788008568933*^9}, {
  3.975788070325145*^9, 
  3.975788070327449*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4f469bd0-b9fd-45ba-829d-\
fb5dd1715a9a"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Velocity-Dependent Terms", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975844402641892*^9, 
  3.9758444072069607`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9efbd38c-19ad-4f55-b070-\
49b7d28900d5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The velocity 4\[NoBreak]-\[NoBreak]vector, tangent to the curve at event ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"z", "(", 
    SubscriptBox["s", "R"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "7f225682-3fa4-4a2b-acd9-b625acf2de52"],
 ", is"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975788262456649*^9, 3.9757882664461308`*^9}, {
   3.9757883547888403`*^9, 3.975788380829968*^9}, {3.975801016335197*^9, 
   3.9758010439851427`*^9}, {3.975801300046092*^9, 3.9758013067276497`*^9}, {
   3.97584446068962*^9, 3.975844477849427*^9}, {3.975862530389208*^9, 
   3.97586255733512*^9}, 
   3.9760229181386013`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"41d7c79d-4c12-4f70-8411-\
0deacc282f8f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  SubscriptBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox[
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "\[Mu]"], "=", 
        RowBox[{
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "z"}], 
          RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "s"}]], "=", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "z"}], 
            RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "t"}]], 
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "t"}], 
            RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "s"}]]}], "=", 
          RowBox[{
           FractionBox["d", 
            RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "t"}]], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"t", ",", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"z", "(", "s", ")"}],
              FontWeight->"Bold"]}], ")"}], 
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "t"}], 
            RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "s"}]]}]}]}]}], 
       "\[RightBracketingBar]"}], 
      RowBox[{"s", "=", 
       SubscriptBox["s", "R"]}]], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["v",
          FontWeight->"Bold"], "R"]}], ")"}], 
      FractionBox[
       RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "t"}], 
       RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "s"}]]}]}], "\[RightBracketingBar]"}], 
   RowBox[{"s", "=", 
    SubscriptBox["s", "R"]}]], TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975788284706999*^9, 3.9757883490198097`*^9}, {
  3.9757884149295*^9, 3.975788523745085*^9}, {3.975788578677643*^9, 
  3.975788578679658*^9}, {3.975801316083103*^9, 3.975801327779203*^9}, {
  3.9758013601415787`*^9, 3.975801371577489*^9}, {3.975801403931205*^9, 
  3.9758014206821327`*^9}},
 CellTags->
  "VELOCITY 4-VECTOR",ExpressionUUID->"570c0541-ef1c-484e-b4ad-0ccab50f118f"],

Cell["Because", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9758010699094152`*^9, 
  3.975801076683733*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e10db6de-931e-485c-9fbb-\
d92ed8524ae9"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    SuperscriptBox["s", "2"]}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
     SuperscriptBox["t", "2"]}], "-", 
    RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["z",
       FontWeight->"Bold"], "2"], "\[VeryThinSpace]"}]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975788605523135*^9, 3.975788672173177*^9}, {
  3.9757887548303537`*^9, 
  3.975788754832501*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"89da1d34-0664-4037-a330-\
dc3dfab1a8e4"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{"1", "=", 
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      FractionBox[
       RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "t"}], 
       RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "s"}]], ")"}], "2"], "-", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
         StyleBox["z",
          FontWeight->"Bold"]}], 
        RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "t"}]], ")"}], "2"], 
     SuperscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "t"}], 
        RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "s"}]], ")"}], "2"]}]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975802444658494*^9, 3.975802497203415*^9}, {
  3.975802528274963*^9, 3.975802557077203*^9}, {3.975802651267496*^9, 
  3.9758026512697287`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ffc98323-6223-41fe-8797-\
57c5a0e7a504"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "we can solve for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"t", "/", "d"}], "\[VeryThinSpace]", "s"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "e444ca7f-4355-4523-b6bd-52246038daf8"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976022933499671*^9, 
  3.976022947030983*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"98a92e5d-48e8-4c85-8321-\
0098ddfcbbee"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Solve", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"1", "==", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["dtds", "2"], "-", 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["dzdt", "2"], 
      SuperscriptBox["dtds", "2"]}]}]}], ",", "dtds"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975802584182991*^9, 3.9758026161515703`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[38]:=",ExpressionUUID->"67de294f-a8fe-42ce-9498-cdfa74a71a69"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"dtds", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"-", 
      FractionBox["1", 
       SqrtBox[
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         SuperscriptBox["dzdt", "2"]}]]]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"dtds", "\[Rule]", 
     FractionBox["1", 
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{"1", "-", 
        SuperscriptBox["dzdt", "2"]}]]]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.97580261851367*^9, 3.975864521833207*^9, 
  3.97588128757717*^9, 3.9758814605907307`*^9, 3.975882543535408*^9, 
  3.975882764363716*^9, 3.975882807102017*^9, 3.97588485794424*^9, 
  3.975969431403618*^9, 3.976022761616404*^9, 3.976026307191001*^9, 
  3.976193815785494*^9, 3.9762896920600557`*^9, 3.976294676014853*^9, 
  3.976294759279336*^9, 3.976295685056479*^9, 3.9763062598121643`*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[38]=",ExpressionUUID->"e3fc1dfd-a5ad-4011-a661-7e97e5c360f8"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "But we defined ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v",
        FontWeight->"Bold"], "R"], "=", 
      FractionBox[
       RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
        StyleBox["z",
         FontWeight->"Bold"]}], 
       RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "t"}]]}], "\[RightBracketingBar]"}], 
    RowBox[{"s", "=", 
     SubscriptBox["s", "R"]}]], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ab2f380-c8de-4c9f-8ccb-33c8746d9566"],
 ". Substitute that inside the radical, and choose the positive solution for \
a time-forward path:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9758010805629272`*^9, 3.975801102273613*^9}, {
  3.975802673403356*^9, 3.975802775805497*^9}, {3.97586200249755*^9, 
  3.975862053304744*^9}, {3.975880441754981*^9, 
  3.975880451097974*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"01327b77-3469-4f09-a48b-\
5ec58204c121"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "t"}], 
      RowBox[{"d", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "s"}]], "\[RightBracketingBar]"}], 
    RowBox[{"s", "=", 
     SubscriptBox["s", "R"]}]], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", 
     SqrtBox[
      RowBox[{"1", "-", 
       SuperscriptBox[
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["v",
          FontWeight->"Bold"], "R"], "2"]}]]], "\[Congruent]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "R"]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975788690880361*^9, 3.9757887641438*^9}, {
  3.975801426781199*^9, 
  3.975801432693922*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"33516f0b-d925-462c-85af-\
7437da7d34c6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Rewrite the velocity four-vector of the source, Equation ",
 
 CounterBox["DisplayFormulaNumbered", "VELOCITY 4-VECTOR"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9758011135725193`*^9, 3.975801119973175*^9}, {
  3.97586210741705*^9, 
  3.975862141958276*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"785b499a-436f-4eba-90db-\
e796686f7dc9"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "\[Mu]"], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "R"], "\[VeryThinSpace]", "(", 
    RowBox[{"1", ",", 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["v",
       FontWeight->"Bold"], "R"]}], ")"}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9757887814707603`*^9, 3.975788816634853*^9}, {
  3.975801170150415*^9, 3.9758011701525917`*^9}, {3.97580144004282*^9, 
  3.975801440640407*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fdae1d85-edd2-4565-905a-\
4984ec209768"],

Cell["so that", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97580112569648*^9, 
  3.975801143568693*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"29b4815c-e3f6-4d14-bbac-\
a61f0115452f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "0"], "=", 
   SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "R"]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9757887814707603`*^9, 3.975788816634853*^9}, {
  3.975788946540753*^9, 3.9757889523228292`*^9}, {3.9758011773097563`*^9, 
  3.97580117731244*^9}},
 CellTags->
  "VELOCITY \
COMPONENTS",ExpressionUUID->"961fbbdb-b30a-4a11-b4b0-91b34003d484"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "i"], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "R"], "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["v",
       FontWeight->"Bold"], "R"], "i"]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9757887814707603`*^9, 3.975788816634853*^9}, {
  3.975788973734891*^9, 3.9757890051387177`*^9}, {3.975801184187944*^9, 
  3.975801184190268*^9}, {3.9758014548357763`*^9, 
  3.975801455528635*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dbd01e5f-1d67-48b8-8bd9-\
84a128300348"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "with the Latin index ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["i", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "bb964190-ff72-4707-92d8-a111017502d3"],
 " iterating over the spatial components, as usual."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975801458843565*^9, 
  3.9758014770504913`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dc8f58cb-34b2-41e1-b6fc-\
cf0b400f6890"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The conclusions above constitute Equation 1.5 in Carlip\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
paper. In summary, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["R", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "22860056-0f72-497a-a038-c189df262fb6"],
 " is the retarded spatial distance from ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"z", "(", 
    SubscriptBox["s", "R"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "e1adc60b-1653-4216-8eac-c1a46bbbde61"],
 " to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["x", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "2339adae-38d6-4c7d-ae94-ca239b18b8c3"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], "R"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "4485bda9-f84b-4ab3-9426-244965be009c"],
 " is the retarded 3\[NoBreak]-\[NoBreak]velocity, and the unit 3\[NoBreak]-\
\[NoBreak]vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["n",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], "^"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "3d519bce-ff61-4bee-b09e-147202f5c11f"],
 " points to the retarded position. Nothing here hints at anything but stock \
special relativity and electrodynamics. But does ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["n",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], "^"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "a5236795-fe23-404c-8636-18310f3baa06"],
 " point in the direction of the force vector? To find out, ",
 StyleBox["we must fish out the electric field from the field strength tensor",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9757817716951*^9, 3.975781797013486*^9}, {
  3.9758011911547937`*^9, 3.975801217599359*^9}, {3.975801248463067*^9, 
  3.975801279249606*^9}, {3.9758014867555943`*^9, 3.9758015716899767`*^9}, {
  3.9758022053466988`*^9, 3.975802254841813*^9}, {3.975863393976129*^9, 
  3.975863394526079*^9}, {3.975863729691186*^9, 3.975863753223963*^9}, {
  3.975961477400131*^9, 3.9759615367304173`*^9}, {3.976023012792178*^9, 
  3.976023064514292*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4402c79d-e13c-4fc0-ba7c-\
a49a4a6409e4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Break up the invariant retarded distance, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["r", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "8d86333e-4665-4dd0-88ca-c828e0ab65af"],
 ", referring to its definition, Equation ",
 
 CounterBox["DisplayFormulaNumbered", "INVARIANT RETARDED DISTANCE"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97597168895573*^9, 3.97597170733698*^9}, {
  3.975971792841483*^9, 3.975971847085188*^9}, {3.9760230734643183`*^9, 
  3.976023090150487*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d50db336-06a2-4c14-8724-\
8e82691ce944"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{"r", "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "0"], 
     SubscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0"]}], "+", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "i"], 
     SubscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "i"]}]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975971850087818*^9, 3.97597187835435*^9}, {
  3.976023193324933*^9, 
  3.976023193327833*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a1a3bab5-5687-4e51-9d89-\
36bb6e4740d6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "where Latin indices, like ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["i", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "8379f385-f18d-4dac-9043-70d2bef94325"],
 ", sum over the spatial components 1, 2, 3. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975971890180085*^9, 3.975972008581917*^9}, 
   3.976023119340425*^9},ExpressionUUID->"87f2aab1-771b-4dd4-ab66-\
ff3af26c07bb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "From the velocity components (Equations ",
 
 CounterBox["DisplayFormulaNumbered", "VELOCITY COMPONENTS"],
 ", ff), we get"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975971890180085*^9, 
  3.975972008581917*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e622638e-56b3-4530-9ce1-\
0340e41d6afe"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{"r", "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "R"], 
     SuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0"]}], "+", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "R"], 
     SuperscriptBox[
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v",
        FontWeight->"Bold"], "R"], "i"], 
     SubscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "i"]}]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97597201162598*^9, 3.975972049857683*^9}, {
  3.975972377332263*^9, 3.975972381552346*^9}, {3.976023199344007*^9, 
  3.976023199345952*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7b6a72ef-0dec-4542-933e-\
4dcad65447da"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "in terms of the retarded 3\[NoBreak]-\[NoBreak]velocity, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["v",
      FontWeight->"Bold"], "R"], "i"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "a4e1aa7f-ce19-4f9b-aeff-81405cb35cf6"],
 ". Now substitute components of the separation vector \[Sigma] from \
Equations ",
 
 CounterBox["DisplayFormulaNumbered", "SEPARATION VECTOR COMPONENTS"],
 ", ff"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975972063833664*^9, 3.975972101463258*^9}, {
  3.9759722643917227`*^9, 3.9759723222997837`*^9}, {3.9759723615699673`*^9, 
  3.9759723718523808`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ac11a69e-9def-4c85-a227-\
8487c29e1dc5"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{"r", "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"R", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
      SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "R"]}], "-", 
     RowBox[{"R", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
      SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "R"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["v",
         FontWeight->"Bold"], "R"], "i"], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox[
        OverscriptBox[
         StyleBox["n",
          FontWeight->"Bold"], "^"],
        FontWeight->"Bold"], "i"]}]}], "=", 
    RowBox[{"R", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
     SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "R"], 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"1", "-", 
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["v",
          FontWeight->"Bold"], "R"], ".", 
        StyleBox[
         OverscriptBox[
          StyleBox["n",
           FontWeight->"Bold"], "^"],
         FontWeight->"Bold"]}]}], ")"}]}]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975972330286902*^9, 3.975972333039647*^9}, {
  3.975972397102573*^9, 3.975972563897704*^9}, {3.97602320668563*^9, 
  3.9760232066877604`*^9}},
 CellTags->
  "SPACE COMPONENTS OF INVARIANT RETARDED \
DISTANCE",ExpressionUUID->"96e17f8a-e8b8-4f02-afe7-4c23e206ac11"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "where the minus sign comes from lowering the components of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["n",
       FontWeight->"Bold"], "^"],
     FontWeight->"Bold"], "i"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "17fd27be-f608-4095-b629-104a04dbae84"],
 " via ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Eta]", 
     RowBox[{"\[VeryThinSpace]", 
      RowBox[{"i", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "i"}]}]], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox[
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["n",
        FontWeight->"Bold"], "^"],
      FontWeight->"Bold"], "i"]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "25c47725-2280-41de-9dee-594b9dd87548"],
 ". "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975972570256925*^9, 
  3.975972674479595*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d5d2b5e6-b70e-4611-a187-\
bf433ba4df2f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "That Equation ",
 
 CounterBox["DisplayFormulaNumbered", 
  "SPACE COMPONENTS OF INVARIANT RETARDED DISTANCE"],
 " gives us the first of an otherwise straightforward set of componentRules:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976023177956829*^9, 3.976023185235264*^9}, {
  3.976023286592067*^9, 3.976023330139141*^9}, {3.976023458544663*^9, 
  3.9760234697378674`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"90bb9201-b0a7-4c20-ba04-\
61f8886f97b3"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "componentRules", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"componentRules", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"r", "->", 
      RowBox[{"R", " ", 
       SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "R"], 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", "nDotV"}], ")"}]}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", "[", 
       RowBox[{"h_", "[", "0", "]"}], "]"}], "->", 
      SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "R"]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", "[", 
       RowBox[{"h_", "[", "ud_", "]"}], "]"}], ":>", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "R"], " ", 
       RowBox[{"v", "[", 
        RowBox[{"h", "[", "ud", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\[Sigma]", "[", 
       RowBox[{"h_", "[", "0", "]"}], "]"}], "->", "R"}], ",", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"n", "[", 
       RowBox[{"h_", "[", "0", "]"}], "]"}], "->", "0"}], ",", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\[Sigma]", "[", 
       RowBox[{"h_", "[", "ud_", "]"}], "]"}], ":>", 
      RowBox[{"R", " ", 
       RowBox[{"n", "[", 
        RowBox[{"h", "[", "ud", "]"}], "]"}]}]}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",\

 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975866097288536*^9, 3.9758661011770973`*^9}, {
   3.976023334826984*^9, 3.9760234310166492`*^9}, {3.976023478598679*^9, 
   3.9760235633070993`*^9}, {3.9762941789815493`*^9, 3.976294184616741*^9}, {
   3.976294317771935*^9, 3.976294454052505*^9}, 3.976294609352178*^9, 
   3.976294687565851*^9, {3.976296197330883*^9, 3.976296197421301*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[39]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e0039dbe-47c6-4768-a7e0-b12e52460087"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Filter out acceleration terms, i.e., any terms depending on ",
 StyleBox["d\[Lambda]ds", "Input"],
 ", "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9760236214655848`*^9, 
  3.976023679634317*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"041ece64-e7f4-4973-a53d-\
84d27525240d"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "accelerationRules", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"accelerationRules", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"d\[Lambda]ds", "[", "_", "]"}], ":>", "0"}], "}"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97602503209688*^9, 3.9760250900040627`*^9}, {
  3.976294012956645*^9, 3.976294013584697*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[41]:=",ExpressionUUID->"1320cda4-efbd-4f02-8289-4ce645c97d52"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(", 
   RowBox[{"FCoulomb", "=", 
    RowBox[{"Fraw", "/.", "accelerationRules"}]}], ")"}], "/.", 
  "dpyRules"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9760236862177258`*^9, 3.976023732252289*^9}, {
  3.976025097689427*^9, 3.9760250990788927`*^9}, {3.976293857513747*^9, 
  3.9762938622687483`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[43]:=",ExpressionUUID->"4bf1a70c-25aa-4c84-be03-e6542ac28bb8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"-", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{"e", " ", 
     SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "\[Nu]"], " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "\[Mu]"], "-", 
       FractionBox[
        SubscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Mu]"], "r"]}], ")"}]}], 
    SuperscriptBox["r", "2"]]}], "+", 
  FractionBox[
   RowBox[{"e", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "\[Mu]"], " ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "\[Nu]"], "-", 
      FractionBox[
       SubscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Nu]"], "r"]}], ")"}]}], 
   SuperscriptBox["r", "2"]]}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976023714821257*^9, 3.9760237334653683`*^9}, 
   3.976025099939502*^9, 3.976026307214113*^9, 3.976193815797505*^9, 
   3.976289692071163*^9, 3.97629386321089*^9, 3.9762940155228853`*^9, 
   3.976294676021446*^9, 3.976294759303547*^9, 3.976295685063154*^9, 
   3.976306259827462*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[43]=",ExpressionUUID->"aef59265-92b2-48d0-bd5f-d313816876ee"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["E", 
     RowBox[{"\[VeryThinSpace]\[VeryThinSpace]", "i"}]], "=", 
    SuperscriptBox["F", 
     RowBox[{"\[VeryThinSpace]", 
      RowBox[{"i", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "0"}]}]]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"4b91bc82-73cd-4b2a-93ea-01870e01fb64"],
 " is the contravariant field vector we seek:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9760247542098627`*^9, 
  3.976024758143989*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5d81d402-24aa-4cbb-b5ba-\
eadd7cbcb539"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(", 
   RowBox[{"Fi0", "=", 
    RowBox[{"FCoulomb", "/.", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\[Mu]", "->", "i"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\[Nu]", "->", "0"}]}], "}"}]}]}], ")"}], "/.", 
  "dpyRules"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976023763954885*^9, 3.97602379390477*^9}, 
   3.976024042822587*^9, {3.976293889747529*^9, 3.97629389383217*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[44]:=",ExpressionUUID->"06703e2a-7f6e-4928-ba20-4d4bbcfeb39e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  FractionBox[
   RowBox[{"e", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "i"], " ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "0"], "-", 
      FractionBox[
       SubscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0"], "r"]}], ")"}]}], 
   SuperscriptBox["r", "2"]], "-", 
  FractionBox[
   RowBox[{"e", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "0"], " ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "i"], "-", 
      FractionBox[
       SubscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "i"], "r"]}], ")"}]}], 
   SuperscriptBox["r", "2"]]}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.976023795002016*^9, 3.9760240434470387`*^9, 
  3.976025104398712*^9, 3.9760263072262487`*^9, 3.976193815802292*^9, 
  3.97628969207655*^9, 3.97629389472086*^9, 3.9762940477680264`*^9, 
  3.9762942493342648`*^9, 3.976294676024447*^9, 3.976294759306807*^9, 
  3.976295685066112*^9, 3.976306259836122*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[44]=",ExpressionUUID->"c69ea463-3773-4b83-9220-1711d7ae6848"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "But ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["Fraw", "Input"], "=", 
    SubscriptBox["F", "\[Mu]\[Nu]"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1cf3213f-b78b-4b2f-9888-f06adf9fee92"],
 " is doubly covariant. So, raising its two Latin (spacelike) indices ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["E", 
     RowBox[{"\[VeryThinSpace]", "i"}]], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["\[Eta]", 
       RowBox[{"\[VeryThinSpace]", 
        RowBox[{"i", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "\[Mu]"}]}]], 
      SuperscriptBox["\[Eta]", 
       RowBox[{"0", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "\[Nu]"}]], 
      SubscriptBox["F", 
       RowBox[{"\[Mu]", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "\[Nu]"}]]}], "=", 
     RowBox[{"-", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["F", 
        RowBox[{"i", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "0"}]], ":"}]}]}]}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"4650b7be-0b67-41d7-8504-136a8614ca01"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976024265674255*^9, 3.9760243366935177`*^9}, {
  3.976024394206341*^9, 3.976024575488525*^9}, {3.976024640167341*^9, 
  3.976024748170663*^9}, {3.976025542451586*^9, 
  3.976025581579741*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2ec7391b-aab3-4cdb-878d-\
0c7686a999a1"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(", 
   RowBox[{"Eraw", "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "Fi0"}], "/.", "componentRules"}], ")"}], "//", 
     "Simplify"}]}], ")"}], "/.", "dpyRules"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976023809863256*^9, 3.9760238447713327`*^9}, {
  3.9762939111415987`*^9, 3.976293915607469*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[45]:=",ExpressionUUID->"ab8adf21-41aa-4afc-84ff-370233e26242"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FractionBox[
  RowBox[{"e", " ", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["n", "i"], "-", 
     SubscriptBox["v", "i"]}], ")"}]}], 
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "+", "nDotV"}], ")"}], "3"], " ", 
   SuperscriptBox["R", "2"], " ", 
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "R", "2"]}]]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.97629471574465*^9, 3.976294759317759*^9, 
  3.976295685075376*^9, 3.976296205724186*^9, 3.976306259845373*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[45]=",ExpressionUUID->"a63442bf-915e-4063-9cb1-bb8a258b6545"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This is equivalent to Carlip\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Equation 1.8 after noting \
that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["n", "i"], "-", 
     SubscriptBox["v", "i"]}], "=", 
    RowBox[{"-", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["n", 
        RowBox[{"\[VeryThinSpace]", "i"}]], "-", 
       SuperscriptBox["v", 
        RowBox[{"\[VeryThinSpace]", "i"}]]}], ")"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "84580f7a-d97a-4128-8c76-ea4f20d49038"],
 ". When there is no acceleration, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox[
       SubscriptBox["n", "i"],
       FontWeight->"Bold"], "^"],
     FontWeight->"Bold"], 
    StyleBox["-",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["v",
      FontWeight->"Bold"], "R"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "96bd64cc-027d-4254-b657-7fa6934a785a"],
 " points along the line connecting the instantaneous position of the source \
and the test particle. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976023878911916*^9, 3.976024004092368*^9}, {
  3.9760241163842897`*^9, 3.976024169864332*^9}, {3.9760251289254007`*^9, 
  3.976025144353327*^9}, {3.976025200382429*^9, 3.976025295353216*^9}, {
  3.9762939618795652`*^9, 3.9762939647689323`*^9}, {3.9762944792202578`*^9, 
  3.976294536235626*^9}, {3.9762963003033*^9, 
  3.976296313695615*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3e098906-8e5a-4d65-9fa7-\
9ad53fdacf66"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Conclusion and Future Work", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97602563979169*^9, 3.976025644099955*^9}, {
  3.9762963490894127`*^9, 
  3.9762963533046093`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4fc4b9ca-b0ac-4950-8e04-\
182488bce321"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook explores a \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] (up-down) \
calculus for tensorial calculations, using the physical example of \
electrodynamical aberration as a proving ground. Our primary objective was to \
trade a bit of the brevity of standard component notation for the reliability \
of explicit valence tracking. We demonstrate that a \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]hybrid\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
approach\[LongDash]custom rules for contraction and gradients while relying \
on Wolfram\[CloseCurlyQuote]s DisplayForm for \
readability\[LongDash]replicates a sophisticated result like \
Li\[EAcute]nard-Wiechert field gradients without the ambiguity of manual \
index management. We verify that for a source moving with constant velocity, \
the velocity-dependent terms in the electromagnetic interaction exactly \
cancel the retardation effects, confirming that the electric field points \
toward the source\[CloseCurlyQuote]s instantaneous position.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9762963410585938`*^9, 
  3.9762965155850782`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"147ba13c-64ac-447e-857b-\
115105919bd4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Future Work: Towards a \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] DSL and \
Compiler", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9762963410585938`*^9, 3.976296545992847*^9}, {
  3.976305572236958*^9, 
  3.976305573726953*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"017919cf-4fee-4d67-93d5-\
8a0623233b2d"],

Cell["\<\
While the current prototype is adequate for our example prototype, several \
avenues for improvement remain if it is to approach a full-featured, embedded \
Domain Specific Language (eDSL) and compiler:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9762963410585938`*^9, 3.9762965132991037`*^9}, {
  3.976296548426527*^9, 3.976296607840444*^9}, {3.976305472496207*^9, 
  3.97630549450338*^9}, {3.976305597988632*^9, 
  3.976305639904071*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3ba93839-3a49-4c9e-a241-\
03e98d2274f6"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Automatic Dummy Index Management", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9762963410585938`*^9, 3.9762965132991037`*^9}, {
  3.976296548426527*^9, 
  3.976296613874961*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d13c567b-e4ff-42fb-8f2f-\
becceb83bbbc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Currently, we rely on the user to manually manage summation indices to \
avoid collisions, e.g., distinguishing the \[Rho] in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"r", "=", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Rho]"], 
     SuperscriptBox["\:200b\[Lambda]", "\[Rho]"]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "36264ec6-4673-4d09-bc5c-88ebed4eee78"],
 " from a free index \[Mu]. A implementation would automatically generate \
unique symbols for dummy indices during contraction. This is a standard \
feature in \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]alpha conversion.\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9762963410585938`*^9, 3.9762965132991037`*^9}, {
  3.976296548426527*^9, 3.976296711532077*^9}, {3.9763056486655617`*^9, 
  3.9763057336274967`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"52918fd7-0e3b-4293-b3be-\
2d0a22d29f4e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Dummy Index Coalescing", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9762963410585938`*^9, 3.9762965132991037`*^9}, {
  3.976296548426527*^9, 
  3.976296722759794*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f3be55a6-0967-4ca8-b13b-\
be97d9dd9b9d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The system should automatically recognize that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Mu]"], 
    SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "\[Mu]"]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "009603d6-0bdd-4f75-9e1e-21c2653e5bab"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Rho]"], 
    SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "\[Rho]"]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "cc545219-8d71-4df3-bcba-03a32901eadf"],
 " are identical scalars. For that matter, they\[CloseCurlyQuote]re also \
identical to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "\[Mu]"], 
    SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "\[Mu]"]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "bb8d3c96-2c84-425e-8fb4-70ce606b261f"],
 ". Pattern matching that ignores the specific names of dummy indices and \
mixed parities in summations would afford better automatic simplification."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9762963410585938`*^9, 3.9762965132991037`*^9}, {
  3.976296548426527*^9, 3.9762967866047773`*^9}, {3.9762968641741467`*^9, 
  3.976296889234891*^9}, {3.976305749083928*^9, 
  3.976305816291926*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d0f69f77-901d-4c18-b792-\
6f6783b87f05"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Native Operator Integration", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9762963410585938`*^9, 3.9762965132991037`*^9}, {
  3.976296548426527*^9, 3.9762967866047773`*^9}, {3.9762968641741467`*^9, 
  3.97629689549835*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e3f961a8-506c-436a-8199-\
5a32b1b0f79b"],

Cell["\<\
We currently rely on a custom fourGrad operator. Future work could  overload \
Wolfram\[CloseCurlyQuote]s built\[NoBreak]-\[NoBreak]in Dt and D operators \
with UpValues that respect \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] valence, \
allowing users to differentiate tensors as naturally as scalar variables \
without \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]stepping out\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] of the \
\[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] framework.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9762963410585938`*^9, 3.9762965132991037`*^9}, {
   3.976296548426527*^9, 3.9762967866047773`*^9}, {3.9762968641741467`*^9, 
   3.976296885662109*^9}, 3.97630546668393*^9, {3.976305832500043*^9, 
   3.976305868781693*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d4130bf4-f6ff-4772-820b-\
8a4152f46aea"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["General Relativity and Curved Space", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9762963410585938`*^9, 3.9762965132991037`*^9}, {
   3.976296548426527*^9, 3.9762967866047773`*^9}, {3.9762968641741467`*^9, 
   3.976296885662109*^9}, 3.97630546668393*^9, {3.976305832500043*^9, 
   3.976305872317452*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"83a74046-6133-433f-85d1-\
4b4f6cebc75e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The rest of Carlip\[CloseCurlyQuote]s paper extends electrodynamical \
aberration to gravitational aberration. To handle gravitation smoothly, we \
must extend fourGrad to the covariant derivative \[Del]\[Mu]\:200b, \
incorporating the Christoffel connection ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     RowBox[{"\[Mu]", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "\[Nu]"}]], "\[Lambda]"], 
   TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "21948dd9-2efd-4760-9bbe-722b8ec3af00"],
 "\:200b. With the index tracking demonstrated here for electrodynamical \
aberration, deriving the Riemann curvature tensor and solving geodesic \
equations symbolically becomes a tractable next step."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9762963410585938`*^9, 3.9762965132991037`*^9}, {
   3.976296548426527*^9, 3.9762967866047773`*^9}, {3.9762968641741467`*^9, 
   3.976296885662109*^9}, 3.97630546668393*^9, {3.976305832500043*^9, 
   3.976306050467279*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"38df37e9-b0fb-42ec-9969-\
ef6f357d3b99"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
},
